---
// About strip — Daniel / Trackt Tech / Tampa
---

<section class="bg-bg-elevated px-5 py-14 md:py-16">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl">
    <div class="scroll-reveal translate-y-8 opacity-0 transition-all duration-700 ease-out flex flex-col items-center gap-8 md:flex-row md:items-start md:gap-12">

      <!-- Monogram avatar — swap the div for an <img> when you have a photo -->
      <div class="flex-shrink-0">
        <!--
          PHOTO SWAP: Replace this entire div with:
          <img src="/images/daniel.jpg" alt="Daniel, founder of Trackt Tech"
               class="h-20 w-20 rounded-full object-cover border-2 border-brand-primary/30 shadow-sm" />
        -->
        <div
          class="flex h-20 w-20 items-center justify-center rounded-full border-2 border-brand-primary/40 bg-white shadow-sm"
          aria-label="Daniel, founder of Trackt Tech"
          role="img"
        >
          <span class="text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-brand-primary" aria-hidden="true">D</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text -->
      <div class="text-center md:text-left">
        <p class="mb-1.5 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-brand-primary">About</p>
        <h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-bold text-text-primary md:text-3xl">Daniel — Trackt Tech</h2>
        <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-text-secondary">
          I'm Daniel, founder of Trackt Tech in Tampa. I build websites, custom software, and automations for small businesses — and my day job is running technical operations at a parts distributor, so I understand your problems from inside the operation, not from an agency office.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/#contact"
          class="mt-5 inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold text-brand-primary transition-opacity duration-150 hover:opacity-70"
        >
          Work with me
          <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M5 12h14"/><path d="m12 5 7 7-7 7"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
